{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whistling Waters is a Steamboat Willie inspired fishing game! Work on a steamboat spending your days fishing. The sea is not friendly, nor is your boss. Catch as many fish as you can to meet your boss' quota and avoid damaging your ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947340/extras/2e788d57cdcc3314df44e21781e87e41.avif?t=1734403749\" width=600 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FISH</strong> to make money. Make sure to reach your quota by the end of each day or else you're fired!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947340/extras/84b05674b4150f471d0757df7fdfcd66.poster.avif?t=1734403749\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947340/extras/84b05674b4150f471d0757df7fdfcd66.webm?t=1734403749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947340/extras/84b05674b4150f471d0757df7fdfcd66.mp4?t=1734403749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>STEER</strong> the ship to avoid damaging the hull. Make sure the steamboat is heading straight every once in a while.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947340/extras/dcb784e4dcb7644aa841daa4fdd7940c.poster.avif?t=1734403749\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947340/extras/dcb784e4dcb7644aa841daa4fdd7940c.webm?t=1734403749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947340/extras/dcb784e4dcb7644aa841daa4fdd7940c.mp4?t=1734403749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>REPAIR</strong> the steamboat if your hull has taken damage. Use the grapple to fish out drift wood for repairs or use your extra money to buy planks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947340/extras/791c223b9bb000a6d4caf461a239b941.poster.avif?t=1734403749\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947340/extras/791c223b9bb000a6d4caf461a239b941.webm?t=1734403749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947340/extras/791c223b9bb000a6d4caf461a239b941.mp4?t=1734403749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947340/extras/157c8f797652b1c310a99e744fb5380d.avif?t=1734403749\" width=600 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NIGHT TIME</strong> comes at the end of each day. Turn in the fish you've caught to see if you met today's quota and use left over money on upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947340/extras/5f14251e65f4d1fcaf6b3433bc0b7ce1.poster.avif?t=1734403749\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947340/extras/5f14251e65f4d1fcaf6b3433bc0b7ce1.webm?t=1734403749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947340/extras/5f14251e65f4d1fcaf6b3433bc0b7ce1.mp4?t=1734403749\" type=\