rn in the fish you've caught to see if you met today's quota and use left over money on upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947340/extras/5f14251e65f4d1fcaf6b3433bc0b7ce1.poster.avif?t=1734403749\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947340/extras/5f14251e65f4d1fcaf6b3433bc0b7ce1.webm?t=1734403749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947340/extras/5f14251e65f4d1fcaf6b3433bc0b7ce1.mp4?t=1734403749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fishing game inspired by Steamboat Willie.</p>","developers":["Luna Apps"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947340/header.jpg?t=1734403749","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2947340/782470/68d22ee32d0ddb102deffea47287551d1178b35b/1750952120/dash_av1.mpd?t=1730950890","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2947340/782470/68d22ee32d0ddb102deffea47287551d1178b35b/1750952120/dash_h264.mpd?t=1730950890","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2947340/782470/68d22ee32d0ddb102deffea47287551d1178b35b/1750952120/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1730950890","id":257071505,"name":"Whistling Waters Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257071505/828af9e2ff01ece17b812a43f3bb338cf663be78/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1730950890"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2947340/691233/682837de2379a841b8a71eadcc2194f01c5e315c/1750952120/dash_av1.mpd?t=1713